:"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Cleburne County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids finished November to December at 49% of normal and September to October at 68%. Every grid had its driest year in 2007, and grid 16377 came in at 47% that year.</p>"}
